---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import RedirectCode from '@/components/RedirectCode.astro'
import AIcs from './static/picture/AIcs.gif'
import './static/css/main.css'
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>2026 최강 주가 예측 AI</title>
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>#particles-js {position: fixed;width: 100%;height: 100%;top:0;left: 0;z-index: -1;}</style>
    <RedirectCode />
</head>
<body>
    <div id="particles-js"></div>
    <main>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="robot-video">
              <Image
                src={AIcs}
                alt="AI 배경 애니메이션"
                width={500}
                height={400}
                style="background-color: transparent !important;width: 50%;height: 100%;object-fit: contain;margin: 0 auto;"
              />
            </div>
            <h1 class="title">2026 최강 AI</h1>
            <h2 class="subtitle">주가 예측 시스템</h2>
            <section class="card">
                <div class="accuracy">
                    예측 적중률 <span class="percent">99.8%</span>
                </div>
                <div class="desc">
                    아래에 종목명이나 종목코드를 입력하시면 AI가 단 1.5초 만에
                    분석해 드립니다.<br>
                    지금까지 <span class="highlight">46,863</span>명이 무료 리포트를 받아봤습니다!
                </div>
            </section>
            <form class="input-group" autocomplete="off" onsubmit="return false;">
                <input type="text" id="inputbox" placeholder="종목명·코드 입력 (예: 삼성전자)" aria-label="종목명 또는 종목코드">
            </form>
            <button class="btn link-btn" type="button" onclick="onLinkBtnClick()">분석 시작</button>
        </div>
        <div
          class="ai-modal"
          id="ai-modal"
          style="display: none;position: fixed;top: 0px;left: 0px;width: 100vw;height: 100vh;z-index: 9999;background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);align-content: center;"
        >
            <div class="ai-progress" id="ai-progress">
                <div class="pro-box" style="background:rgb(5 16 26);border-radius:12px;padding:32px 18px;max-width:340px;margin:60px auto;">
                    <div class="title" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:18px;">
                        <div class="word" style="font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;">분석 진행 중...</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="progress-box">
                        <div class="item" style="margin-bottom:16px;">
                            <div class="i-title" style="font-size:15px;">시장 분석</div>
                            <div class="layui-progress layui-progress-big" lay-filter="progress-1" style="background:#eee;border-radius:8px;height:16px;">
                                <div class="layui-progress-bar" id="bar-1" lay-percent="0%" style="width: 0%;background:#00dcf4;height:100%;border-radius:8px;"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="item" style="margin-bottom:16px;">
                            <div class="i-title" style="font-size:15px;">차트 분석</div>
                            <div class="layui-progress layui-progress-big" lay-filter="progress-2" style="background:#eee;border-radius:8px;height:16px;">
                                <div class="layui-progress-bar" id="bar-2" lay-percent="0%" style="width: 0%;background:#00dcf4;height:100%;border-radius:8px;"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="item">
                            <div class="i-title" style="font-size:15px;">뉴스·공시 분석</div>
                            <div class="layui-progress layui-progress-big" lay-filter="progress-3" style="background:#eee;border-radius:8px;height:16px;">
                                <div class="layui-progress-bar" id="bar-3" lay-percent="0%" style="width: 0%;background:#00dcf4;height:100%;border-radius:8px;"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
<div class="ai-result" id="ai-result" style="display:none;">
                <div class="result-box" style="background:rgb(5 16 26);border-radius:12px;padding:32px 18px;max-width:340px;height: inherit;margin:60px auto;">
                <div class="title" style="margin-bottom:18px;">
                    <div class="word" style="font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;">
                        <span id="tips-code" style="color:#15a223;"></span> 📊 종목 리포트 준비 완료
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="result-con">
<div class="con" style="font-size:15px; margin-bottom:18px; color: #ffffff; text-align: center;">
    <div>
        🔍 분석 리포트가 완성되었습니다. <strong>카카오톡</strong> 친구 추가만 하시면 리포트를 보내드리고, 이번 주 급등 유망주 3종목도 함께 보내드립니다.
        <br><br>
        ✅ 리포트 주요 내용
        <ul style="padding-left: 0; list-style: none; margin-top: 8px; text-align: center;">
            <li>단기 주가 흐름 전망</li>
            <li>매수·매도 타이밍 분석</li>
            <li>애널리스트 투자의견 등급</li>
        </ul>
        <br>
        ⏰ <span style="color: #e67e22; font-weight: bold;">오늘 자 업데이트 · 무료 열람 마감 임박</span>
        <br>
        💬 전문 상담사가 1:1 실시간 대기 중입니다.
    </div>
</div>
                    <button class="btn" onclick="showline()" id="chat-btn" style="background:#fee500;color:#191919;padding:12px 0;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;width:100%;margin:0 auto;animation:breath 1.6s infinite;" type="button">
                        💬 카카오톡으로 무료 리포트 받기
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
